Z||000014||HF6582||03-30-2000||05:34 PM||||I am currently working on gathering the parts to build one.  You better have a <B>deep</B> pocket, because they are quite expensive.  Several of the GM parts are still available, so shop around. <P>Just a note the SD4 aluminum head is still available, but pricey (almost $1000.00).<P>Everyone says just drop in a v6 or whatever, I'm just doing it for the fun of it.  <P>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000015||88 Fiero||03-30-2000||08:04 PM||||When they were available back in the 80's..I called John Callies...the guy who builds them and was quoted for $10,000.00 for that engine...not cheap...||||reg||1
Z||000016||Cooter||03-30-2000||09:52 PM||||I asked about buying a used SD4 and was told this:<BR>"The SD4 was the engine of choice for the Goody's Dash Series. Now because of a rules change, the engines are fast becoming obselete. A used, race ready SD4 can possibly be purchased from one of these race teams as they switch to the v6 engines."<P>I am not familiar with the Goody's series, but surely somebody here knows something about it- let us know if you do!||||reg||1
Z||000017||Oreif||03-31-2000||02:20 AM||||If you are serious about getting an SD4 I suggest you call Vanderley Engineering in Biloxi, Mississippii. at 1-601-435-1582. They were very big at building SD4 motors. I called them a few years ago and they still had some parts (heads and cranks) and they had a list of persons to call to buy the already built motors. I know at the time I called they had a list of numerous motors in various parts of the country. But they are not cheap. Basically the price structure was<BR>2.7L 200hp = $8500<BR>3.0L 315hp with carb = $10,500<BR>3.0L 330 with injection was $13,500<BR>For parts cranks were $539<BR>Bare heads = $429<BR>used heads = $800 to $1000 (Fully assembled)<P>"Speed is just a question of money....<BR>How fast do you want to go?"||||reg||6
Z||000018||Oreif||03-31-2000||01:00 PM||||I found this place on the net. They make SD4 engines. I guess they use the Pontiac design. Sort of a clone SD4.<BR>the link is: <A HREF="http://www.gtsonline.com/krp/prod1.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gtsonline.com/krp/prod1.htm</A> ||||reg||4
